# Tools Spec

Read `.cursor/skills/eva-specs/tools.md` (full: `E.V.A./docs/TOOLS_SDK_SPEC_v0.1.md`).

- Tool = capability; no business logic, no FSM control
- One package per tool under `backend/tools/<name>/`
- Import via package: `from tools.telegram import TelegramTool`
- Commands in Action recipe; events published by runtime
- New tool: package + catalog + loader + frontend registry
